      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d309aea68ce0068e",
      "translationZh": "本文延续了前几篇文章中的小模型浏览器实验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4da54995d5f7cc14",
      "translationZh": "两个标准的现成模型在同一台 Samsung Galaxy S21 上本地运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "65dc3c867eacd620",
      "translationZh": "Gemma 4 E2B，Q3_K_M，作为推理器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3ed7b02c259a8cb",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.5-0.8B，Q4_K_M，作为执行器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab9408b57928a3f6",
      "translationZh": "没有微调，没有针对特定任务的训练，也没有适配器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9f00bd800cf708f",
      "translationZh": "一个持久化台账记录了任务状态、约束、验证和恢复信息。浏览器感知与操作通过我们开发的 E2LLM/SiFR 在用户现有的 Firefox 会话中进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb5ade342b8caa94",
      "translationZh": "任务：在 Amazon 上准备一套 Instax Mini 12 套件，价格低于 200。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc91341275228116",
      "translationZh": "第 1 次运行：组合套装路线，购物车中有 2 个条目，190.98。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b5f4490b9cb588d",
      "translationZh": "第 2 次运行：各自独立的产品，选择了价格为 179.95 的薄膜，超出预算，随后改选更便宜的替代品，购物车中有 4 个条目，总额为 143.86。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d9c8e7445239c12",
      "translationZh": "两次运行均以 READY_FOR_HUMAN_REVIEW 状态结束。没有结账或购买。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28e98232d761d57e",
      "translationZh": "附带的视频以 x16 倍速展示了两次完整运行。原始会话：约 51 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbcb3b53c8b3368d",
      "translationZh": "任务由账本掌管。每个模型只负责下一步有明确边界的决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "613adadd174cb3ad",
      "translationZh": "所有证据均已在 GitHub 上的 e2llm/edge-browser-agent 中公开，位于 amazon-dual-slm-ledger 文件夹：完整原始日志、实际使用的脚本、启动器和 SHA-256 哈希值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "436e40f64f932e55",
      "translationZh": "欢迎提出想法、异议、失效模式和替代设计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
